1
00:04:38,460 --> 00:04:39,840
By the way, my thoughts go out to everyone

2
00:04:39,840 --> 00:04:40,850
who won't win tonight.

3
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:45,240
I've been there.

4
00:04:46,990 --> 00:04:48,340
It's a horrible feeling.

5
00:04:50,850 --> 00:04:53,080
You feel dazed,

6
00:04:53,730 --> 00:04:56,180
diminished, useless.

7
00:04:56,930 --> 00:04:58,310
You walk down the street talking to

8
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:58,720
yourself.

9
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,630
But careful, those of you who won't

10
00:05:01,630 --> 00:05:02,800
win: you're being filmed.

11
00:05:05,010 --> 00:05:05,500
Seriously,

12
00:05:05,910 --> 00:05:07,450
you have to be a good loser, you mustn't…

13
00:05:07,450 --> 00:05:10,550
Because according to

14
00:05:10,550 --> 00:05:11,690
statistics, people watch the losers

15
00:05:11,690 --> 00:05:13,120
more than the winners.

16
00:05:14,410 --> 00:05:16,110
This is important: stay

17
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:17,740
dignified, stay dignified.

18
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:20,950
And dignity is hard to act,

19
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:21,860
not everyone pulls it off.

20
00:05:22,950 --> 00:05:24,630
Actually, ladies and gentlemen of

21
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,210
the Academy, we should create a César for

22
00:05:26,210 --> 00:05:26,740
that:

23
00:05:27,470 --> 00:05:29,350
the César for the one who loses and best

24
00:05:29,350 --> 00:05:30,530
pretends to be happy for

25
00:05:30,530 --> 00:05:31,660
the winner.

26
00:05:33,050 --> 00:05:33,720
Wait, wait,

27
00:05:36,990 --> 00:05:39,570
wait… this

28
00:05:39,570 --> 00:05:42,610
César, I'd

29
00:05:42,610 --> 00:05:44,110
give it without hesitation to Gilles

30
00:05:44,110 --> 00:05:44,840
Lellouche.

31
00:05:47,090 --> 00:05:49,820
He's SO good at losing!

32
00:05:50,350 --> 00:05:52,190
He's gutted and it never shows! Does it

33
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:54,150
show? He wants to die

34
00:05:54,150 --> 00:05:54,660
inside.

35
00:05:55,110 --> 00:05:57,120
But he's stone-faced, you see nothing.

36
00:05:57,470 --> 00:05:59,460
Gilles, if you're listening, we love you.
